                        Pelcovits. Repeated to USUN.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d34-f2" n="2" xml:id="d34-f2-content">
                <p>The Report of the President’s Commission for the Observance of the 25th
                    Anniversary of the United Nations was released on April 26, 1971. (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Weekly Compilation of Presidential Documents</hi>, May
                    3, 1971, pp. 708–709)</p>
            </note>
